' ===================== Application -> Common -> Entity =====================
JavaApplication ..> FileStorageUtil
FileStorageUtil ..> User

' ===================== DTO <-> Service dependencies =====================
LoginRequestDto ..> BasicUserService
UserCreateRequestDto ..> BasicUserService
UserUpdateRequestDto ..> BasicUserService
BasicUserService ..> UserResponseDto
UserIdRequestDto ..> BasicUserService

ChannelResponseDto ..> BasicChannelService
ChannelUpdateRequestDto ..> BasicChannelService
PublicChannelCreateRequestDto ..> BasicChannelService
PrivateChannelCreateRequestDto ..> BasicChannelService
ChannelIdRequestDto ..> BasicChannelService

MessageCreateRequestDto ..> BasicMessageService
MessageUpdateRequestDto ..> BasicMessageService
BasicMessageService ..> MessageResponseDto
MessageIdRequestDto ..> BasicMessageService

ReadStatusCreateRequestDto ..> BasicReadStatusService
ReadStatusUpdateRequestDto ..> BasicReadStatusService
ReadStatusIdRequestDto ..> BasicReadStatusService

UserStatusCreateRequestDto ..> BasicUserStatusService
UserStatusUpdateRequestDto ..> BasicUserStatusService
UserStatusIdRequestDto ..> BasicUserStatusService

BinaryContentCreateRequestDto ..> BasicBinaryContentService
BasicBinaryContentService ..> BinaryContentResponseDto
BinaryContentIdRequestDto ..> BasicBinaryContentService

' ===================== Service -> Repository (interface) =====================
BasicUserService ..> UserRepository
BasicChannelService ..> ChannelRepository
BasicMessageService ..> MessageRepository
BasicReadStatusService ..> ReadStatusRepository
BasicUserStatusService ..> UserStatusRepository
BasicBinaryContentService ..> BinaryContentRepository

' ===================== Repository (interface) <|.. Repository (JCF) =====================
UserRepository <|.. JCFUserRepository
ChannelRepository <|.. JCFChannelRepository
MessageRepository <|.. JCFMessageRepository
ReadStatusRepository <|.. JCFReadStatusRepository
UserStatusRepository <|.. JCFUserStatusRepository
BinaryContentRepository <|.. JCFBinaryContentRepository

@enduml
